sequenceDiagram
    participant PO as Platform Operator
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant TC as Trainer Controller<br/>Informer (scoped)
    participant JSO as JobSet Operator<br/>operator.openshift.io
    participant CM as ConfigMap<br/>Target Namespace
    participant TM as Bundled Templates<br/>/opt/*-template/
    participant NS as Target Namespace

    Note over PO,NS: Reconciliation Trigger
    PO->>K8s: Create/Update Trainer CR<br/>(components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1)
    K8s-->>TC: Watch event<br/>(namespace-scoped informer)

    Note over TC,JSO: Dependency Verification (OpenShift)
    TC->>K8s: Check JobSet Operator CRD exists<br/>(operator.openshift.io/jobsetoperators)
    K8s-->>TC: CRD found
    TC->>K8s: Check JobSetOperator CR exists
    K8s-->>TC: CR found
    TC->>K8s: Check JobSet Operator health
    K8s-->>TC: Healthy

    alt Dependency check fails
        TC->>K8s: Set Trainer CR status: Degraded
        Note over TC: Reconciliation halted
    end

    Note over TC,NS: Manifest Rendering & Deployment
    TC->>K8s: Ensure target namespace exists
    TC->>CM: Read platform version ConfigMap
    CM-->>TC: Version info
    TC->>TM: Render manifests-template/
    TM-->>TC: Trainer infrastructure manifests
    TC->>TM: Render runtimes-template/
    TM-->>TC: Training runtime manifests
    TC->>TM: Render imagestreams-template/
    TM-->>TC: Image stream manifests

    TC->>K8s: Apply manifests (field owner: trainer-module-controller)<br/>with apply ordering
    K8s-->>TC: Resources created/updated

    Note over TC,K8s: Garbage Collection
    TC->>K8s: Remove stale resources<br/>(previous version cleanup)

    Note over TC,NS: Observation Surface
    TC-->>TC: Expose metrics :8080/TCP (plaintext HTTP)
    TC-->>TC: Health :8081/healthz, Readiness :8081/readyz
